{"seq":16,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:59:57.945Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"5366baecc3dc906f542c2778f9affc97ffb4ad1c6e84b7954b0138c07c4bf5e0","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Sofia, here's what I found for the Saltmarsh Provisions handover:\n\n1. *Takeover:* Moss's Coastal note of 5 Oct 2025 says Saltmarsh \"changes hands tomorrow, Monday, October 6\" (2025). It doesn't name the new owner. Moss's later notes call it \"Bettina's grocery account\", and Bettina's 17 Nov post calls it \"Sofia's old grocery account\". So that's Bettina Kroll from 6 Oct 2025. Please check that against whatever you hold, since no note says it in one line. The 2 Nov note about a handover on 3 Nov is for Pellucid Harbor Logistics, not Saltmarsh.\n2. *Discount:* 10%. Bettina posted 12% on 17 Nov 2025, then corrected it five minutes later: \"ignore my earlier note, it's 10%\" (she had misread a draft worksheet).\n3. *Corinne's admin access issue:* PD-4827, opened by Kwame on 15 Oct 2025. Don't confuse it with PD-4824, which is the door 3/4 exception-report question.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
