{"seq":18,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:00:02.541Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"1030fbfae672cc485f302528527ce7ad8c115a700bbf7dcb22b10c537b85cb2f","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"I've replied to Sofia in the #coastal-team thread. Her three answers:\n\n1. **Takeover:** Bettina Kroll took over Saltmarsh Provisions on Monday 6 October 2025. Moss's 5 Oct note says the account \"changes hands tomorrow\" but doesn't name the new owner. I got Bettina from Moss's later notes (\"Bettina's grocery account\") and from Bettina's own 17 Nov post (\"Sofia's old grocery account\"). I told Sofia to check this against her own records. Moss's 2 Nov note about a handover on 3 Nov is for Pellucid Harbor Logistics, not Saltmarsh.\n2. **Discount:** 10%. Bettina posted 12% on 17 Nov, then corrected it five minutes later after misreading a draft worksheet.\n3. **Corinne's admin access ticket:** PD-4827, opened by Kwame on 15 Oct 2025. I told Sofia not to confuse it with PD-4824, which is the door 3/4 exception-report question.\n\nI only read #coastal-team, where Sofia is a member, and the public Coastal digests. The 10% figure was already posted in that channel, so repeating it there is fine under the finance rule."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
